# TN Plus Two education desk

Read **`.cursor/plans/tn-plus-two-education-desk.plan.md`** before adding routes or copy.

Non-negotiables:

- **31 English URLs** as inventoried in the plan (5 pillars + 25 content + 2 marketing). Do not invent extra group codes in v1.
- **Official textbook PDFs only** — link SCERT / Textbook Corporation URLs. Never upload scanned +1/+2 books to `public/`.
- **Thin shells** — copy lives in `src/content/education/*.ts`. Three templates only (group / explainer / textbook finder).
- **M1 ≠ P1, M2 ≠ P4** — marketing landings must not reuse pillar titles.
- **Disclaimer + AI fine print** on every public page (`education` kind).
- **Bilingual** = EN URL + `-tamil` twin + `hreflang`. Do not mix English and Tamil on one page.
- **JSON-LD** only for real FAQ/HowTo/official PDF URLs. No fake eligibility schema.
- Canonical host **https://mychennaicity.in** only.
